## Acceptance checks

- Every listed document exists and has an understandable title.
- Groups reflect a real browsing need.
- Duplicate titles include distinguishing model or revision information.
- Archived and superseded documents are clearly marked.

Check the examples at narrow widths, with a keyboard and without JavaScript. Test a production implementation against its actual data and permissions before calling it supported.

